      <Corpo> Filter dimensions: H= 212 mm. L= 300 mm. S= 30 mm. &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;B&gt; Estimated replacement time: &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; 20 minutes &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;B&gt; Location: &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt;  &lt;LI&gt; Inside the passenger compartment &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;LI&gt; Passenger side &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;B&gt; Replacement: &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;LI&gt; Remove the plastic bulkhead under the glove compartment &lt;BR/&gt;  &lt;LI&gt; Disconnect the footwell light wiring harness located in the plastic bulkhead &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;LI&gt; Move the air vents slightly to allow easy access to the cabin filter &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;LI&gt; Remove the cabin filter cover cap &lt;BR/&gt;  &lt;LI&gt; Slide the filter out along the guides of the housing (from top to bottom) &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;B&gt; Reassembly: &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;LI&gt; Perform the procedure in reverse order</Corpo>
